# Read an exit plan

::: float {side=left}
![Floor plan showing the north exit beside the meeting room](/assets/floor-plan.png){size=small alignment=left}

Find the north exit on the plan. Keep the route clear before work begins.
:::

::: float {side=right}
![Diagram showing a clear route to the south exit](/assets/exit-route.png){size=medium alignment=right}

Follow the marked route to the south exit when the north exit is blocked.
:::

::: columns
:: {weight=2}
### Main route

Use the nearest clear exit.

::
### Backup route

Check the alternate route before your shift.
:::
